00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:21.960
prvi program, ki sem ga napisal z njim, v

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:26.879
osnovi in ​​je bila trivialna igra Star Wars, sedel je

00:05:26.879 --> 00:05:28.680
